  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Government of the Solomon Islands to Implement the Extractive Industry Transparency Initiative (SI-EITI Support Project)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project &#x201c;Support to the Government of the Solomon Islands to Implement the Extractive Industry Transparency Initiative (EITI)&#x201d;, funded by the Government of the United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland, aims to strengthen the Solomon Islands&#x2019; governance and transparency in the extractive industries sector. The initiative seeks to support the Government&#x2019;s renewed commitment to accountability and sound public financial management by facilitating its re-engagement with the EITI international framework and building the institutional foundations for effective implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
